{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓星邊佑錫今日（23日）現身香港尖沙咀名店，以品牌大使身份出席活動，獲數百中、港、韓粉絲冒雨撐場。邊佑錫原定會進行Q&amp;A環節，但由於天雨關係臨時取消，身穿皮褸及間條上衣登場的他，最後僅出來拍照，快閃不足1分鐘就離去，但仍有把握時間對現場粉絲揮手、派心等等。</p><figure><img alt=\"韓星邊佑錫 （변우석 ）今日（23日）現身香港尖沙咀名店，以品牌大使身份出席活動。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648177250439168308526.jpeg/qukUK3kACHmdDmoxXQql0CDQrNyA4SMh5pjGcMCYxnA\"/><figcaption>韓星邊佑錫 （변우석 ）今日（23日）現身香港尖沙咀名店，以品牌大使身份出席活動。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中、港、韓粉絲冒雨撐場。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648175417528320243985.jpeg/W7k5puRCLaJ5726mSGHY2K_fQ4FU-e_09eX5-NPl-fg\"/><figcaption>中、港、韓粉絲冒雨撐場。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"粉絲延伸到較外圍位置。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648171655106560172903.jpeg/QM3-z7Sv5uWg5wBr0mFTmEqgZKP1SQvUdJ7qPFKe6jw\"/><figcaption>粉絲延伸到較外圍位置。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大量邊佑錫粉絲在店外守候。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648187648512000134976.jpeg/bz5vwH0DLJ5quKNcIaLsQUku_oddfUIoeQAfI18AHyM\"/><figcaption>大量邊佑錫粉絲在店外守候。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邊佑錫原定會進行Q&amp;A環節，但由於天雨關係臨時取消。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648184657842176913062.jpeg/ienw71Q5upL3EM53nInNJkmYbjMQSJBqQqOd8mSjnfI\"/><figcaption>邊佑錫原定會進行Q&amp;A環節，但由於天雨關係臨時取消。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邊佑錫最後僅出來拍照，快閃不足1分鐘就離去。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648181486817280752641.jpeg/YHRfg_J5OkhlQqaJo_qo07udpF4MTCcRYqhprkSoaa4\"/><figcaption>邊佑錫最後僅出來拍照，快閃不足1分鐘就離去。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邊佑錫仍有把握時間對現場粉絲揮手、派心等等。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648172200366080026189.jpeg/XvKwo2ZSycHfH6Q0ThESjdGMkO9w1VG_hmYvH6BmLx8\"/><figcaption>邊佑錫仍有把握時間對現場粉絲揮手、派心等等。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邊佑錫仍有把握時間對現場粉絲揮手、派心等等。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648185224204288013967.jpeg/aGF9t3LSkY4ZWL_o8ofS-w3uhrd7Jqx54dq1SMfatUg\"/><figcaption>邊佑錫仍有把握時間對現場粉絲揮手、派心等等。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邊佑錫（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648182187397120028537.jpeg/reqgaWeyb7_KN04pFJ5Tr_-PpTv5zRUBR21uQGFtbkA\"/><figcaption>邊佑錫（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邊佑錫（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648179024760832920718.jpeg/9PjWwGNsrSTHEY2czMH1ER_-0ATYap4NOJLGeh6Sxno\"/><figcaption>邊佑錫（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邊佑錫（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648175778238464395728.jpeg/vfJQLR5_F0GYSX4HdWoSxf5EPa-mztqgoKU6c4alOnM\"/><figcaption>邊佑錫（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"臨走前，邊佑錫跟粉絲們講拜拜。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201648172158423040568910.jpeg/CACtZ7J3hpBYRNzankOeQrRr6Cp4LTZ8Qs5Wh2TOVoc\"/><figcaption>臨走前，邊佑錫跟粉絲們講拜拜。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.875013+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":405,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:45:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T15:30:03.244167+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:47.543192+00:00","content_hash":"e10b918c6894d20a70d0df842d6bcf5031316465646012208370578ef6a17477","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}